# <type>(<scope>)<!>: <subject>
#
# Subject: imperative mood ("add", not "added"), lowercase, no trailing
#         period, 72 characters or fewer.
# Types:  feat  fix  docs  style  refactor  perf  test  build  ci  chore  revert
# Scopes: player  hud  enemies  level  art  audio  docs  build
#
# Examples:
#   feat(player): add locked-direction dash with 0.35s cooldown
#   fix(hud): stop mugshot flicker when health changes
#   chore(art): export 32x32 PI sprite sheet from LibreSprite
#
# Body (optional): explain WHY the change was made, wrapped at 72 chars.
#                  Leave one blank line between subject and body.
#
# Footer (optional): issue references and breaking changes.
#   Closes #12
#   BREAKING CHANGE: input map changed, remap dash before pulling
